  - m_Id: 10913412359991296
    m_Localized: ARCHIVED MESSAGE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10913412359991297
    m_Localized: 'Hi, {PLAYER_NAME}.


      If you''re reading this, then "WATCHER"
      has completed its task, and neither of us is among the living anymore.


      Kind
      of sad, isn''t it? Neither you nor I will ever see the results of our work
      with our own eyes.


      Still, we did what we had to do.


      I''m grateful
      that you volunteered to take part in the "WATCHER" project. I doubt we could
      have found a better candidate.


      After all, who could be better suited
      to the role of Watcher than the Bureau''s first director?


      Thank you.


      Your
      friend,

      Miles

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10913412359991298
    m_Localized: There is nothing to redact this time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10895718273331211
    m_Localized: DOCUMENT No. ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10895718273331212
    m_Localized: ARCHIVED MESSAGE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10895718273331213
    m_Localized: 'Hi, {PLAYER_NAME}.


      If you''re reading this, then "WATCHER"
      made it through.


      I left this recording in case part of your memory
      remains inaccessible.


      You volunteered.


      It was your decision.
      I promised to leave you at least this much proof.


      The rest may already
      be beyond recovery. But I suppose you still remember the most important thing
      - why we did this.


      Thank you.


      Your friend,

      Miles'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
