    m_Localized: ARCHIVED MESSAGE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10913412364185605
    m_Localized: 'Hi, {PLAYER_NAME}.


      If you''re reading this, then "WATCHER"
      made it through.


      I left this recording in case you ever start wondering
      why you ended up here.


      [cycle=You volunteered willingly|Bureau made
      decision|Participation status lost|Record was altered,interval=1.2-2.4]Participation
      status lost[/]


      I''m sorry...


      But if you''re still doing this
      work, then some part of you must still remember what we were trying to protect.


      Keep
      them safe.


      Miles'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10913412364185602
